      "problem": "Which of the following statements are true regarding the function $y=\\operatorname{sec}⁡x?$\n\nI. The period of the function is $\\pi .$\n\nII. The function is increasing in the interval $(-\\frac{\\pi }{2},0].$\n\nIII. The function has no zeros.",
